### -------------------------------------
### GFWList Diagnostics
### Required: locationId=
### -------------------------------------

### Get diagnostics data for ADMINISTRATIVE_AREAS
### requires a locationId
POST https://localhost:8443/diagnostics/1
Content-Type: application/zip
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
  "locationId": 1544
}

